{\small\itshape\color{LightGray} "Our Lord, come!" · 主必快來——全書貫穿的盼望}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\lambsymbol\hspace{0.2cm}{\color{ScriptureGold}\rule{1.8in}{0.8pt}}\hspace{0.2cm}\lambsymbol

\vspace{0.8cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 關於本書}\qquad{\large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} About This Book}

\vspace{0.5cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{TextGray}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書逐段研讀啟示錄全書二十二章，以渐进启示的終點為視角，整合黃長老查經教導法、John MacArthur 逐節解經講道（gty.org）、以及 G.K. Beale、Robert Mounce、Grant Osborne 等當代學者的解經洞見。全書貫穿透視人性、出路何在、神的計劃、宇宙爭戰四大主題，從榮耀基督的異象、七教會的呼召，經過印、號、碗的審判，直到巴比倫傾覆、基督再來、千年國度，終於新天新地與新耶路撒冷——見證神永恆計劃的完成，以及信、望、愛在羔羊婚筵中的終極實現。

A chapter-by-chapter study of all twenty-two chapters of Revelation, read as the culmination of progressive revelation, integrating Elder Wong's Bible teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition (gty.org), and the exegetical insight of contemporary scholars G.K. Beale, Robert Mounce, and Grant Osborne. The study traces four themes threading through the whole book --- human nature exposed, the way of escape, God's plan fulfilled, and the cosmic conflict --- from the glorified Christ and the call to the seven churches, through the judgments of the seals, trumpets, and bowls, to the fall of Babylon, the return of Christ, and the millennial kingdom, arriving finally at the new heaven, the new earth, and the New Jerusalem --- witnessing the completion of God's eternal plan and the final consummation of faith, hope, and love at the marriage supper of the Lamb.
$endif$
\end{minipage}

